ce_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041001","verified_at":"2026-10-25T05:50:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1846651706684288","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.37 Update","summary":"Updated Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo to v0.7.37.Update NotesAdded a special \"Paint Battle\" rule that automatically activates when both players select the Art Club character in Versus Mode. The winner is determined by the paint coverage percentage at the end of the match.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:44:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684288","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1846651706676163","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.36 Update","summary":"Updated Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo to v0.7.36.Update NotesRedesigned the Shot Controls guide to make it easier to understand how to perform each type of shot.Added instructions to the Local Versus player join screen explaining how to set up and play with two players on a single keyboard.Fixed an issue where the selection would unexpectedly move when changing control presets in the Options menu.Fixed an issue where the ESC key would not work for canceling actions or pausing during matche","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:58:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676163","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1846018067942660","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.35 Update","summary":"Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo has been updated to v0.7.35.Update NotesAdjusted character behavior during matches to better reflect each character's unique personality.Fixed an issue where the selected text in the tutorial dialog on first launch was invisible because its color matched the background.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:03:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1845383656395195","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.34 Update","summary":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo has been updated to v0.7.34.Update DetailsThe demo title screen has been redesigned.The title screen background has been updated with a new design.Character-specific title backgrounds are now unlocked by clearing each character's story.You can select the following options from Options > Title Background:RandomSimpleUnlocked Character BackgroundsYour selected title background setting is saved and will carry over the next time you launch the game.Fixed an is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T03:34:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1845383656390661","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.33 Update","summary":"The Shuttle Hearts Demo has been updated to v0.7.33.Update NotesFixed an issue where moving the cursor over an unavailable character on the Character Select screen could cause the game to become unresponsive.Updated some character graphics.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T07:09:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390661","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1844751498230385","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"update","title":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo v0.7.30 Update","summary":"The Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Demo has been updated to v0.7.30. Update DetailsImproved tutorial controlsAdded safeguards to help prevent accidental use of the “Back” actionImproved the behavior of the SP Skill “Breaking Point” during tutorial practiceAdjusted CPU behavior when preparing and activating SP ShotsUpdated some character graphics","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T02:50:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4988110-1843481262687830","game_id":"steam-4988110","kind":"announcement","title":"Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash Free Demo Now Available!","summary":"The free demo for Shuttle Hearts - Academy Smash is now available on Steam!Play as four characters — Go-home Club, Athletics Club, Art Club, and Karate Club — and get an early taste of the game’s fast-paced badminton battles, character abilities, SP Shots, and SP Skills.What You Can Play in the DemoStory Mode (Partial)Versus ModeVS CPULocal 2-PlayerPlayable CharactersGo-home ClubAthletics ClubArt ClubKarate ClubBoth keyboard and gamepad controls are supported.Four Characters, Four Different Play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T03:00:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https:/